%% M6 public tracking page (guest, masked). Editable source for sequence-m6-public-tracking-page.svg / .png.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor G as Guest
    participant PG as Next.js page /track
    participant GW as API gateway
    participant T as tracking-service
    participant M as MongoDB tracking
    participant S as Socket.IO /ws/tracking
    G->>PG: open /track/SD261020K7Q2M9X
    PG->>GW: GET /api/v1/tracking/public/{trackingNumber} no token
    GW->>GW: rate limit per IP, Redis counter
    GW->>T: forward public route
    T->>M: find timeline by trackingNumber
    M-->>T: timeline document
    alt found
        T->>T: PublicViewMapper, city and masked name K*** P.
        T-->>GW: 200 status, city, masked recipient, steps
        GW-->>PG: 200 JSON
        PG->>S: connect, join tracking:SD261020K7Q2M9X
        S-->>PG: joined
        S-->>PG: parcel.status OUT_FOR_DELIVERY, Kandy
    else not found
        T-->>GW: 404 problem+json, same answer for any unknown number
        GW-->>PG: 404 problem+json
    end
    Note over G,PG: Page shows city and masked name only, never phone or street
